# Registry block folder structure (shadcn-style)

All blocks live under `registry/new-york/blocks/<block-id>/` with sub-folders matching shadcn's conventions.

## Source layout

```
<block-id>/
  page.tsx                      # preview wrapper — stays at root (registry:page)
  components/
    <block-id>.tsx              # default export (registry:component)
    <sub-component>.tsx         # additional components (registry:component)
  hooks/
    use-*.ts                    # hooks (registry:hook)
  lib/
    config.ts                   # constants / config (registry:lib)
    <data>.ts                   # other data files (registry:lib)
  styles/
    <block-id>.css              # block-specific styles (registry:file)
```

## Target layout (installs in user's project)

```
app/<block-id>/page.tsx
app/<block-id>/components/<block-id>.tsx
app/<block-id>/components/<sub-component>.tsx
app/<block-id>/hooks/use-*.ts
app/<block-id>/lib/config.ts
app/<block-id>/styles/<block-id>.css
```

## Imports inside a component

```ts
import Sub from "./sub-component"           // sibling in components/
import { useFoo } from "../hooks/use-foo"   // hook
import { ITEMS } from "../lib/config"       // lib data
import "../styles/<block-id>.css"           // styles
```

## Imports in page.tsx (root)

```ts
import BlockName from "./components/block-name"
```

## Cross-block imports (from inside components/)

```ts
import BrandsV1 from "../../brands-section-v1/components/brands-section-v1"
```

## Do not

- Place components at the block root (except page.tsx)
- Mix sub-folder files with root files
- Add `tailwind.config.js` or `@import "tailwindcss"` inside a block folder
